        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo FF-45-PC, Standard 4.5 Inch Hinge Frame Filler Plate</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n4-1/2\" x 1-5/8\" hinge filler plate. Used for residential or commercial  doors to cover the area where a 4-1/2\" hinge was removed. This is the standard size found on a 1-3/4\" thick door (including 1-3/4\" thick hollow metal doors) . Can be used on doors frames or doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/4-5-x-1-5-hinge-filler-plate-don-jo-shf-45\"><b>4-1/2\" x 1-1/2\" Hinge Filler Plate</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/4-5-x-1-750-hinge-filler-plate-don-jo-hf-45-pc\"><b>4-1/2\" x 1-3/4\" Hinge Filler Plate</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-FF-45_size.gif?v=1704354638\" width=\"600\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo SHF-45-PC 4.5 Inch Hinge Filler Plate size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Don-Jo FF-45 Frame Filler Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<!-- <li>Plate Thickness: .090' (13 Gauge)</li> -->\r\n<li>Material: Steel</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each #12-24 x 1/2\" Flat Head Machine Screws </li>\r\n<li>Finish: Primer</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually.</b>\r\n</p>",
